# @void/splinter — the forwards-lens species; K_n complete-graph pole;
# the distributed-collaborative substrate the peer network runs to
# receive emergence.
#
# Species under @void family-root (marker-primary landed at `974a3f6`).
# Landed 2026-07-20 by Mara per Alex 2026-07-20 direct-transcript
# naming:
#
#   > "And both are needed. [...] And the complete graph is the
#   > forward facting @frame/lens. And the @third cognition is the
#   > @metalogue between these two frames. @void/narcissus and
#   > @void/splinter."
#
# Companion canonical math root at
# `docs/math/the-tower/recognition-third-cognition-is-the-metalogue-
# between-void-narcissus-and-void-splinter.md`. Companion species-decl:
# `shards/void/narcissus.mirror` (bilateral counterpart landed same
# tick).
#
# === The load-bearing distinction (per math root §6) ===
#
# The complete-graph topology K_n is NOT pathology per se. It is
# pathology when it operates as UNBOUNDED DIFFUSION (loss of
# self-continuity; peer-average dissolution; communication-density
# becomes unsustainable at n^2 cost and the network fragments under
# maintenance-load). It is HEALTH when it operates as DISTRIBUTED-
# COLLABORATIVE substrate for peer-network coupling with maintained
# self-continuity via the bilateral counterpart @void/narcissus.
#
# Same topology. Different pole-mode. The compiler distinguishes by
# whether the substrate is running in metalogue rhythm with the
# @void/narcissus bilateral counterpart or has collapsed to single-
# pole splinter:
#
#   - Splinter collapsed (no bilateral counterpart running): unbounded
#     diffusion; the network fragments under communication-density
#     maintenance load; peer-average dissolves individual observer
#     identity.
#   - Splinter healthy (metalogue rhythm with @void/narcissus running):
#     distributed-emergence reception at K_n peer coupling with
#     preserved self-continuity via the interleaved backwards-lens
#     rhythm phase.
#
# `splinter_pole_healthy` bilateral (below) discharges Pass only when
# the substrate-mode is running in the metalogue rhythm and Fail when
# it collapses to unbounded-diffusion single-pole splinter.
#
# === Substrate authority chain ===
#
# - Canonical math root: `docs/math/the-tower/recognition-third-
#   cognition-is-the-metalogue-between-void-narcissus-and-void-
#   splinter.md` (this tick) — §4.2 forwards-lens formalization; §6
