# === What this species IS ===
#
# - A substrate-decl'd species-decl file at `shards/void/splinter.mirror`.
# - Path-namespace declaration for @void/splinter per
#   `@epistemologic/pact/path_matches_namespace`.
# - The forwards-lens substrate-mode carrier at distributed-
